#: ../../administration/integrations/workers.rst:7
msgid ""
"The |morpheus| Worker is a separately deployed service that can proxy "
"Cloud and Agent traffic, route console and VDI sessions, and act as a "
"quorum witness for supported HVM clusters. A single Worker runtime can "
"provide more than one capability, but each capability uses a specific "
"registration and key in |morpheus|."
msgstr ""

#: ../../administration/integrations/workers.rst:9
msgid ""
"Distributed Workers, including Workers used as HVM quorum witnesses, are "
"available in VM Essentials, Advanced, and Enterprise. The VDI Gateway use"
" case requires an Advanced or Enterprise license."
